@startuml Sequence_Flow_Consoles_Detaille
!theme plain
title Séquences d'Interaction - Consoles POS et Maison Mère

skinparam backgroundColor #f8f9fa
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

participant "Console POS" as POS #FFEB3B
participant "Kong Gateway" as Kong #2196F3
participant "Hybrid Router" as Router #9C27B0
participant "Legacy System" as Legacy #FF9800
participant "Stock μService" as Stock #4CAF50
participant "MySQL DB" as MySQL #F44336
participant "Redis Cache" as Redis #795548

== SÉQUENCE 1: AUTHENTIFICATION POS ==

POS -> Kong: **POST /pos/auth**\nX-Client-Type: pos\n{username, password, magasin_id}
Kong -> Router: Forward request with headers
Router -> Legacy: **POST /api/v1/auth**\n(Route: POS → Legacy)

note over Legacy
  **Legacy gère:**
  - Validation utilisateur
  - Création session
  - Vérification magasin
end note

Legacy -> MySQL: SELECT utilisateurs, sessions
MySQL --> Legacy: User data + permissions
Legacy -> Redis: SET session_id = user_data
Legacy --> Router: **{token, user_info, permissions}**
Router --> Kong: Forward response
Kong --> POS: **✅ Auth Success + Session Token**

== SÉQUENCE 2: CONSULTATION PRODUITS (POS) ==

POS -> Kong: **GET /pos/produits**\nAuthorization: Bearer token
Kong -> Router: Route analysis
Router -> Legacy: **GET /api/v1/produits**\n(Route: POS → Legacy)

note over Legacy
  **Legacy gère:**
  - Catalogue produits
  - Prix par magasin
  - Disponibilité générale
end note

Legacy -> MySQL: SELECT produits, prix
MySQL --> Legacy: Product catalog
Legacy --> Router: **{produits: [...]}**
Router --> Kong: Forward response
Kong --> POS: **📦 Liste des produits**

== SÉQUENCE 3: VÉRIFICATION STOCK TEMPS RÉEL (POS) ==

POS -> Kong: **GET /pos/stock/produit/123**\nCheck real-time stock
Kong -> Router: Route analysis
Router -> Stock: **GET /stocks/produit/123**\n(Route: POS → Stock μService)

note over Stock
  **Stock μService gère:**
  - Stock temps réel
  - Seuils d'alerte
  - Mouvements récents
end note

Stock -> MySQL: SELECT stocks, mouvements_stock
MySQL --> Stock: Current stock level
Stock --> Router: **{quantite: 45, seuil_min: 10, status: "OK"}**
Router --> Kong: Forward response
Kong --> POS: **📊 Stock en temps réel**

== SÉQUENCE 4: CRÉATION VENTE (POS) ==

POS -> Kong: **POST /pos/ventes**\n{produit_id, quantite, prix}
Kong -> Router: Route analysis
Router -> Legacy: **POST /api/v1/ventes**\n(Route: POS → Legacy)

note over Legacy
  **Legacy gère:**
  - Création vente
  - Validation business
  - Calculs totaux
end note

Legacy -> MySQL: INSERT INTO ventes, vente_details
Legacy -> Stock: **PUT /stocks/produit/123/ajuster**\n{quantiteAjustement: -2}

note over Stock
  **Mise à jour stock:**
  - Soustraction quantité
  - Vérification seuils
  - Log mouvement
end note

Stock -> MySQL: UPDATE stocks, INSERT mouvements_stock
Stock --> Legacy: **{nouveau_stock: 43, alerts: ["STOCK_FAIBLE"]}**
Legacy -> MySQL: UPDATE ventes SET statut = "validee"
Legacy --> Router: **{vente_id, total, stock_status}**
Router --> Kong: Forward response
Kong --> POS: **✅ Vente créée + Alerte stock**

== SÉQUENCE 5: CONSULTATION MAGASINS (MAISON MÈRE) ==

participant "Console Maison Mère" as MM #E91E63

MM -> Kong: **GET /maisonmere/magasins**\nX-Client-Type: maisonmere
Kong -> Router: Route analysis
Router -> Legacy: **GET /api/v1/magasins**\n(Route: Maison Mère → Legacy)

note over Legacy
  **Legacy gère:**
  - Liste des magasins
  - Informations détaillées
  - Gestionnaires
end note

Legacy -> MySQL: SELECT magasins, utilisateurs
MySQL --> Legacy: Store data with managers
Legacy --> Router: **{magasins: [...], gestionnaires: [...]}**
Router --> Kong: Forward response
Kong --> MM: **🏢 Liste des magasins**

== SÉQUENCE 6: RAPPORTS AVANCÉS (MAISON MÈRE) ==

MM -> Kong: **GET /maisonmere/reports/sales?periode=mois**\nAdvanced analytics request
Kong -> Router: Route analysis
Router -> ReportingMS: **GET /api/reports/sales?periode=mois**\n(Route: Maison Mère → Reporting μService)

participant "Reporting μService" as Reporting #8BC34A

note over Reporting
  **Reporting μService gère:**
  - Analytics avancées
  - Agrégation multi-sources
  - Cache intelligent
end note

Reporting -> Redis: GET report_cache_key
Redis --> Reporting: Cache miss
Reporting -> MySQL: Complex aggregation queries\n(ventes, magasins, utilisateurs)
Reporting -> Legacy: **GET /api/v1/ventes-consolidees**\nGet additional legacy data
Legacy -> MySQL: SELECT legacy sales data
Legacy --> Reporting: Legacy sales data
Reporting -> MySQL: Combine with microservice data
MySQL --> Reporting: Aggregated results
Reporting -> Redis: SET report_cache = results (TTL: 1h)
Reporting --> Router: **{analytics: {...}, kpis: {...}, charts: {...}}**
Router --> Kong: Forward response
Kong --> MM: **📊 Rapport analytique avancé**

== SÉQUENCE 7: API MODERNE V2 (WEB APP) ==

participant "Web App" as Web #00BCD4

Web -> Kong: **GET /api/v2/produits**\nModern API request
Kong -> Router: Route analysis
Router -> Produit1: **GET /produits**\n(Route: API v2 → Produit μService)

participant "Produit μService" as Produit #4CAF50
participant "PostgreSQL" as Postgres #673AB7

note over Produit
  **Produit μService gère:**
  - API REST moderne
  - Base dédiée PostgreSQL
  - Load balancing
end note

Produit -> Postgres: SELECT FROM produits
Postgres --> Produit: Product data
Produit --> Router: **{produits: [...]}** (JSON moderne)
Router --> Kong: Forward response
Kong --> Web: **🚀 API moderne response**

== MONITORING & METRICS ==

note over Kong, Redis
  **Monitoring continu:**
  - Tous les services → Prometheus
  - Métriques en temps réel
  - Dashboards Grafana
  - Alertes automatiques
end note

@enduml
